OL,3,CFour teenagers arrested after
OL,4,C'deliberate' fire as wildfires continue
OL,6,FFour teenage boys have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a deliberate fire in Porth,
OL,8,FRhondda Cynon Taf.
OL,10,FSouth Wales Police confirmed four 14-
OL,11,Fyear-old boys from Porth have all been
OL,12,Farrested on suspicion of arson and
OL,13,Fhave since been bailed under
OL,14,Finvestigation.
OL,16,FDetective Inspector Steve Jones said:
OL,17,F"These incidents put communities at
OL,18,Frisk, can impact people's health,
OL,19,Fthreaten wildlife, and divert
OL,20,Femergency resources away from people
OL,21,Fwho need us.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
