OL,3,CFour teenagers arrested after
OL,4,C'deliberate' fire as wildfires continue
OL,6,F"Deliberately starting fires is a
OL,7,Fcriminal offence. If you see
OL,8,Fsuspicious behaviour or have
OL,9,Finformation about deliberate fire-
OL,10,Fsetting, please report it to
OL,11,FCrimestoppers by calling 0800 555 111
OL,12,For the police by calling 101."
OL,14,FThe arrests come as two major
OL,15,Fincidents have been declared in south
OL,16,Fand west Wales as a result of
OL,17,Fwildfires.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/5
