OL,3,CFour teenagers arrested after
OL,4,C'deliberate' fire as wildfires continue
OL,6,FOn Friday (August 14) the Prime
OL,7,FMinister confirmed the military has
OL,8,Fbeen deployed to help tackle major
OL,9,Fwildfires across south Wales.
OL,11,FIt comes after an emergency UK
OL,12,FGovernment Cobra meeting on Wednesday
OL,13,F12 August to consider the response to
OL,14,Fongoing wildfires across the country.
OL,16,FMr Burnham said 100 personnel had been
OL,17,Fsent to help in south Wales, where
OL,18,Fthere are fires in places like
OL,19,FBlaenavon and Porth.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/5
