OL,3,CFour teenagers arrested after
OL,4,C'deliberate' fire as wildfires continue
OL,6,FAn emergency alert was sent to phones
OL,7,Fin England and Wales on Friday
OL,8,Fevening, urging people not to start
OL,9,Ffires.
OL,11,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fpreviously declared a "major incident"
OL,13,Facross the region because of the
OL,14,Famount of blazes that have broken out.
OL,15,FOn Thursday, the service said it was
OL,16,Fat 30 wildfire incidents.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/5
