OL,3,CFour teenagers arrested after
OL,4,C'deliberate' fire as wildfires continue
OL,6,FThe service said it submitted a
OL,7,Frequest for military aid "to provide
OL,8,Fadditional logistical and defensive
OL,9,Ftactical support" after "an extended
OL,10,Fperiod of hot weather and significant
OL,11,Foperational demand".
